B_k = mu + Delta_k. Estimation uses the covariance-only proximal-gradient
solver (\code{\link[=multitask_pgd]{multitask_pgd()}}) on subject-specific (N_k-weighted) latent
cross-products, and the penalties (lambda_mu, lambda_delta) are selected over
a \code{n_lambda_mu x n_lambda_delta} grid using EBIC (\code{\link[=multitask_ebic]{multitask_ebic()}}).
}
\details{
